  "description": "Verify that the system validates the minimum order value for a particular coupon, prevents any discount from exceeding the subtotal, recalculates the cart totals accurately on the Cart page after coupon validation and discount application, and shows the applied coupon details only when the cart is eligible; otherwise, the coupon is rejected and the cart totals remain unchanged.",
  "priority": "critical",
